#: tips.cpp:18
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can start a new standard session by pressing the \"New\" "
"button in the tabbar?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:23
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing and holding the \"New\" button on the tabbar will "
"display a menu of sessions to select?\n"
